											</h2>
				
					<p class="post-meta"><span class="published">Aug 28, 1998</span></p><div class="post-content"><div class="post-content-inner"><p>Findings: regarding the Declaration of Disaster Emergency due to the catastrophically low salmon returns in certain communities and the region of Western Alaska.</p>
</div><a href="https://gov.alaska.gov/admin-orders/administrative-order-no-178/" class="more-link">read more</a></div>			
			</article>
				
			<article id="post-10444" class="et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_no_thumb et_pb_blog_item_0_1 post-10444 admin-orders type-admin-orders status-publish hentry governor-all-admin-orders governor-tony-knowles">

				
