											</h2>
				
					<p class="post-meta"><span class="published">Aug 7, 1998</span></p><div class="post-content"><div class="post-content-inner"><p>Ordering the Disaster Relief Fund to cover expenditures of qualified individuals for certain essential needs in the Regions of Western Alaska due to the catastrophically Low salmon returns.</p>
</div><a href="https://gov.alaska.gov/admin-orders/administrative-order-no-176/" class="more-link">read more</a></div>			
			</article>
				
			<article id="post-10442" class="et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_no_thumb et_pb_blog_item_0_3 post-10442 admin-orders type-admin-orders status-publish hentry governor-all-admin-orders governor-tony-knowles">

				
