					<p class="post-meta"><span class="published">Jun 8, 1998</span></p><div class="post-content"><div class="post-content-inner"><p>Ordering findings concerning the siting and construction of State owned, and State financed construction projects.</p>
</div><a href="https://gov.alaska.gov/admin-orders/administrative-order-no-175/" class="more-link">read more</a></div>			
			</article>
				
			<article id="post-10440" class="et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_no_thumb et_pb_blog_item_0_4 post-10440 admin-orders type-admin-orders status-publish hentry governor-all-admin-orders governor-tony-knowles">

				
														<h2 class="entry-title">
